Herdr app configuration (herdr-dots)

This project is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE).

Parts of it are derived from other Apache-2.0 work:

- mods/relevo and mods/ion-files derive from
  herdr-relevo (https://github.com/johnny4young/herdr-relevo, Apache-2.0).
  Changes: Linux behavior (bash launchers, Claude credential files, GNU stat,
  gio trash), separate accounts and launchers in Settings, a smaller scope
  (Inbox, PR review and time ledger removed), Linear and GitHub PR panels
  living in their own mods.
- mods/ion-files, mods/ion-changes and mods/ion-tabs derive
  from the agents, files, changes and tabs mods that ship with Herdr
  (Apache-2.0). See each mod's README for what changed.
- mods/better-sidebar derives from Better Sidebar in munza/herdr-mods
  (https://github.com/munza/herdr-mods, Apache-2.0). Changes: Relevo account
  dots, handoff, background-work capsule and launcher, and a polished header.
